### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### List calibrations (all equipment units)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/calibrations
Accept: application/json

### Filter calibration needs (due within next period)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/calibrations/needs-calibration
Accept: application/json

### Get calibration history for a unit
GET {{baseUrl}/api/items/1/units/1/calibrations
Accept: application/json

### Create calibration record
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calibrations
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "item_unit_id": 1,
  "calibration_date": "2026-08-01",
  "next_calibration_date": "2027-02-01",
  "calibrated_by": "Dr. Ahmad",
  "certificate_number": "CERT-2026-001",
  "result": "lulus",
  "notes": "Kalibrasi berhasil, hasil dalam batas toleransi"
}

### Get maintenance records for a unit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/1/units/1/maintenances
Accept: application/json

### Create maintenance record
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/maintenances
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "item_unit_id": 1,
  "maintenance_date": "2026-08-07",
  "description": "Perbaikan housing mikroskop akibat retakan",
  "performed_by": "Teknik Laboratorium",
  "cost": 750000,
  "status": "selesai",
  "notes": "Perbaikan selesai dengan baik"
}

### Get maintenance history for an item
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/1/maintenances
Accept: application/json